			"notes": "# Beta 0.2.0\n## New Entities:\n- Grindstone Golem\n  - Behaves like an Iron Golem, attacking hostile mobs except the creeper, and it is attacked by them\n  - Has 3 different crack levels, corresponding to its health\n  - Has 4 different variants\n  - Its health can be restored with Stone or Cobblestone\n  - It can be spawned from a Carved Pumpkin block on top of an Grindstone block\n- Mossy Golem\n  - Behaves like an Iron Golem, attacking hostile mobs except the creeper, and it is attacked by them\n  - Its health can be restored with Stone or Cobblestone\n  - It can be spawned from a Carved Pumpkin block on top of a Moss Block\n## Technical News:\n- Made GeckoLib an external dependency and updated version to 3.1.38\n- Updated Fabric Launcher version to 0.14.12\n- Updated Fabric API version to 0.70.0"
		},
