			"notes": "# Beta 0.1.0\n## New Entities:\n- Plank Golem\n  - Behaves like an Iron Golem, attacking hostile mobs except the creeper, and it is attacked by them\n  - Has different arrow levels, when it is full it has 64 arrows\n  - Can receive arrows either from player hand or from the ground\n  - Its health can be restored with Oak Planks\n  - It can be spawned from a Carved Pumpkin block on top of an Oak Planks block\n  - It prefers to run instead of attacking the enemy if it is not far enough"
